          "question": {
            "text": "If <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>27</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>999</mn></mrow></msup></math> is divided by <math><mn>7,</mn></math> then the remainder is",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "JT2zR",
              "text": "<math> <mtext>1</mtext></math>",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            },
            {
              "id": "IKVWt",
              "text": "<math> <mtext>2</mtext></math>",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            },
            {
              "id": "6lauh",
              "text": "<math> <mtext>3</mtext></math>",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            },
            {
              "id": "eQaeZ",
              "text": "<math> <mtext>6</mtext> </math>",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": true
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "Express the given number <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mn>27</mn></mrow> <mrow> <mn>999</mn></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math> as <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mn>28</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mrow> <mn>999</mn></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math><br />Now, divide by <math> <mrow>  <mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></math> <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow> <mrow> <mn>999</mn></mrow> </msup> </mrow> <mn>7</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br />and apply the formula of binomial expansion.<br />We get the reminder as <math> <mrow> <mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow> </math>",
